# This repository is public. Git ignores every path that is not listed below, so a stray
# "git add ." cannot pick up internal files. To add a feed, add its folder and files here
# AND to .github/allowed-paths.txt (the repo-checks workflow enforces that list).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/SECURITY.md

!/sso-vishing/
/sso-vishing/*
!/sso-vishing/README.md
!/sso-vishing/CHANGELOG.md
!/sso-vishing/doppel-sso-vishing.csv

.DS_Store
